  m_text: 'You are Princess Rose, and you have run away from home and locked yourself
    in a tower to enjoy some peace and quiet. But your father, the King, won''t leave
    you alone, and keeps sending knights to try and "rescue" you. What a jackass!


    Using
    the bones of your fallen enemies, build your defences to stop the swarm of knights
    before they reach the tower. Crush them all!'
